  "summary": {
    "en": "In the past 8 hours the DSH plugin ecosystem added 41 new plugins, reaching 19,041 total, while the official repo gained 145 stars and npm weekly downloads hit 355,149. Ebony-Vinyl/dsh-our-free-model led growth with +747 stars, but a health score of 38 and 14,985 plugins stale for 7 days point to widening activity gaps worth monitoring.",
